    <body>
      <p style="text-indent: 5em" rend="first-line-indent(5)" source="#source-437-486"><g ref="#gaiji-1-3-27" source="#source-452-482">◉</g></p>
      <p source="#source-486-527"><seg source="#source-486-527">温たかき玉は、君が手より、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-527-550"><seg source="#source-527-550">すべり落ちぬ。</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-550-591"><seg source="#source-550-591">その玉は他人の手に握られ、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-591-629"><seg source="#source-591-629">楽しき夢路をたどるなり。</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 3em" rend="first-line-indent(3)" source="#source-629-673"><seg source="#source-629-673">あゝ君は淋しき人なり。</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 3em" rend="first-line-indent(3)" source="#source-673-714"><seg source="#source-673-714">君はいや更に悲しめ！</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 3em" rend="first-line-indent(3)" source="#source-714-770"><seg source="#source-714-770">もだへ、苦しむは君のさがなり。</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-770-853"><hi rend="bouten 傍点 right" source="#source-770-818" corresp="#source-782-818"><seg source="#source-770-782">ぬめらか</seg></hi><seg source="#source-818-853">なる玉は、すべり安く、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-853-924"><hi rend="bouten 傍点 right" source="#source-853-901" corresp="#source-865-901"><seg source="#source-853-865">ふしくれ</seg></hi><seg source="#source-901-924">だちし手には、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-924-974"><seg source="#source-924-974">あまりに痛ましく、たへがたく――</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-974-1057"><seg source="#source-974-998">すべり落つるも、</seg><hi rend="bouten 傍点 right" source="#source-998-1046" corresp="#source-1010-1046"><seg source="#source-998-1010">ことわり</seg></hi><seg source="#source-1046-1057">なり。</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 3em" rend="first-line-indent(3)" source="#source-1057-1101"><seg source="#source-1057-1101">あゝ君は淋しき人なり。</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 3em" rend="first-line-indent(3)" source="#source-1101-1142"><seg source="#source-1101-1142">君はいや更に悲しめ！</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 3em" rend="first-line-indent(3)" source="#source-1142-1193"><seg source="#source-1142-1193">もだへ、苦しむは君のさがなり</seg></p>
    </body>
